<body>
<div type="letter">
<pb facs="1362083" n="1"/>
  <opener><abbr>Ill.<hi rend="sup">mo</hi></abbr> <choice><abbr>S.<hi rend="sup">re</hi></abbr><expan>Signore</expan></choice> <choice><abbr>S.<hi rend="sup">re</hi></abbr><expan>Signore</expan></choice> <choice><abbr>P<supplied>.</supplied>rone</abbr><expan>Patrone</expan></choice> <choice><abbr>Col<supplied>.</supplied>mo</abbr><expan>Colendissimo</expan></choice>

      <lb/><rs key="place_GEO-3171728" type="place">Pad.<hi rend="sup">a</hi></rs> <choice><abbr>ult.<hi rend="sup">o</hi></abbr><expan>ultimo</expan></choice> Giugno</opener>
  <p><choice><orig>E</orig><reg>È</reg></choice> qualche tempo, che non hò nuova
      <lb/>della di Lei persona: si degni darmene
      <lb/>alcuna: e se alcuna ne ha di
      <lb/>letteraria mela partecipi pure; onde
      <lb/>conversiamo anco in distanza; et Ella
      <lb/>s’eserciti nella gentil nostra Italiana
      <lb/>favella.</p>
  <p><choice><orig>E</orig><reg>È</reg></choice> pregata fare anco questa settimana
      <lb/>premure <choice><orig><g ref="#per">&#42833;</g></orig><reg>per</reg></choice> la spedizione del consaputo
      <lb/><rs type="biblio">libro</rs> da <rs key="place_GEO-2661604" type="place">Basilea</rs>, che molto l<unclear reason="illegible">e</unclear>
      <lb/>raccomando, e raccomando.</p>
  <p>Quando escano le <rs type="biblio">Opere</rs> <rs key="pers_DE-588-104265264" type="person">Morgagni</rs> Ella
      <lb/>avrà subito li due essemplari da
      <lb/>me, che ne hò (in promessa) alcuni
      <lb/><choice><orig><g ref="#per">&#42833;</g></orig><reg>per</reg></choice> ce<unclear reason="illegible">r</unclear>to negozio.</p>
  <p>Ella è riverita <abbr>divota.<hi rend="sup">e</hi></abbr> da tutti di
      <lb/>casa, et io con distinzione, e tutta la verità mi giuro</p>
  <closer>Di <choice><abbr>V<supplied>.</supplied></abbr><expan>Vostra</expan></choice> <choice><abbr>S<supplied>.</supplied></abbr><expan>Signoria</expan></choice> <choice><abbr>Ill.<hi rend="sup">ma</hi></abbr><expan>Illustrissima</expan></choice>
      <lb/><choice><abbr>Di.<hi rend="sup">mo</hi></abbr><expan>Divotissimo</expan></choice> <choice><abbr>Obbl.<hi rend="sup">mo</hi></abbr><expan>Obbligatissimo</expan></choice> <choice><abbr>ser.<hi rend="sup">e</hi></abbr><expan>servitore</expan></choice> et <choice><abbr>A.<hi rend="sup">o</hi></abbr><expan>Amico</expan></choice>
      <lb/><signed><rs key="pers_DE-588-11887733X" type="person">Giovanni Poleni</rs></signed></closer>
<pb facs="1362085" n="2" type="empty"/>
</div>
